TITLE Scenario 6898: pH=7.5, Low, Fulvic=50mg/L, Clay, Wet, Ionic=Medium
SOLUTION 1  RI contaminated soil pore water
    temp      25
    pH        7.5
    pe        3
    units     mol/L
    # Heavy metals
    Pb        1.2066e-04  # 25 mg/L
    Cu        3.1471e-04  # 20 mg/L
    Zn        4.5886e-04  # 30 mg/L
    Cd        1.7792e-05  # 2 mg/L
    # Competing cations
    Ca        4.9900e-04  # 20 mg/L
    Mg        4.1135e-04  # 10 mg/L
    # Ionic strength (salinity)
    Na        2.1749e-02  # 500 mg/L
    Cl        1.9746e-02  # 700 mg/L
    # Dissolved organic carbon
    C(4)      2.4305e-04  # 40 mg/L base DOC
    # Fulvic acid: 50 mg/L (as additional DOC)
    
SURFACE 1  Soil mineral surfaces (Fe/Al oxides)
    Hfo_wOH   1.5  600  0.09
    -equil 1
    
END
